{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KrQbrLHaWSYkvNHtfe8XQf","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# symb_invariant_consensus — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 06:18 UTC | 更新原因: D021 scope 扩展：补 5 个新实验(Mistral/LLaMA/GSM8K/constraint-ablation/DeepSeek-R1) + Claim 2 reframe + GPU 排期更新\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nSymbolic Invariant Consensus Aggregation (SICA)：从多条 LLM 推理路径中提取符号约束，通过加权 partial MAX-SAT 找到全局一致的约束子集，提供 principled tiebreaking。核心 insight：符号共识的有效性取决于 trace diversity (C0)——追踪认知不确定性的零成本指标，跨模型家族和推理域通用。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research（Post-MVP, D021 Scope 扩展）** — MVP D012 PASS（C3=+3.3pp）。正在：(1) 扩大样本量 exp-001 804题 RUNNING (2) 补 3 个非 Qwen 模型 + GSM8K 跨域 + constraint ablation 以满足 A 类 scope 要求。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键 Checkpoint\\\\n**May 19 UTC**：全部 GPU 实验完成 → 数据充分性判定 → 冲 EMNLP May 25 ARR 或切 AAAI Aug 1\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (paper_framing.md)\\\\n1. Principled Tiebreaking — SICA 通过约束权重打破 SC 平票\\\\n2. Operating Regime — C0 追踪认知不确定性，决定 SICA 是否有效。跨 3 家族 (Qwen/Mistral/LLaMA) + 2 reasoning 架构 (QwQ/DeepSeek-R1) 验证\\\\n3. C0 as Diagnostic — 多候选率可预测 SICA 部署价值\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 执行排期（串行，单 GPU）\\\\n\\\\n| 序号 | 实验 | 模型 | 优先级 | GPU-h | 状态 |\\\\n|------|------|------|--------|-------|------|\\\\n| 1 | exp-001 sica_expanded_14b | 14B | P0 | ~13h remaining | RUNNING |\\\\n| 2 | exp-002 sica_k_ablation | 14B (same vLLM) | P0 | 5h | planned |\\\\n| 3 | exp-012 gsm8k_pilot_14b | 14B (same vLLM) | P1 | 1h | planned |\\\\n| 4 | exp-010 sica_mistral_7b | Mistral-7B | P0 | 1.5h | planned |\\\\n| 5 | exp-011 sica_llama_8b | LLaMA-8B | P0 | 1.5h | planned |\\\\n| 6 | exp-004 sica_7b_scaling | Qwen-7B | P1 | 2h | planned |\\\\n| 7 | exp-014 sica_deepseek_r1 | DeepSeek-R1-7B | P1 | 2h | planned |\\\\n| 8 | exp-007 sica_72b_awq | Qwen-72B-AWQ | P1 | 4h | planned |\\\\n\\\\n**Total: ~31h → 完成 ~May 18 11:00 UTC**（May 19 checkpoint 有 margin）\\\\n\\\\nCPU 并行（不占 GPU）：\\\\n- [x] exp-003 tiebreak baseline (done on D012, re-run on expanded after exp-001)\\\\n- [x] exp-005 QwQ-32B operating regime data (done)\\\\n- [ ] exp-013 constraint ablation (MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight) — after exp-001\\\\n- [ ] exp-009 overhead analysis — after exp-001\\\\n- [ ] exp-008 case studies — after exp-001\\\\n- [ ] exp-006 C0 diagnostic validation — after exp-001/002/004/010/011/014\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Agent 下载 Mistral-7B / LLaMA-8B / DeepSeek-R1-7B 模型（CPU，exp-001 期间并行）\\\\n- [ ] Agent 准备 GSM8K-200 数据集 + 评估脚本\\\\n- [ ] Agent 写 analyze_expanded.py 分析脚本\\\\n- [ ] exp-001 完成后立即跑分析 + 启动 exp-002\\\\n- [ ] exp-013 constraint ablation 脚本准备（CPU-only）\\\\n- [ ] Dream dream_20260516T054054 完成后处理报告\\\\n\\\\n## MVP 结论（已锁定）\\\\n- **QwQ-32B**: 全域 C0=3.6%, SICA≡SC。模型级自一致性。\\\\n- **Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct**: C0=53.3%, SICA 73.3% vs SC 70.0% (+3.3pp)。5 个 6:6 平票 SICA 4/5 正确 (80%)。\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- westd-32608: 1× NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell (98GB), cuda:0\\\\n- 当前：exp-001 RUNNING (PID 181491, ETA ~13h)\\\\n- 总 GPU 预算：~31h（含 D021 新增 ~7h）\\\\n- May 19 前有 ~72h 窗口，单 GPU 充足\\\\n\\\\n## 目标投稿\\\\n- 主目标：EMNLP 2026（ARR May 25）\\\\n- 后备：AAAI 2027（Aug 1）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-16 | D023: Contingency plan 确认——如 SICA≤SC 则 pivot 到 Ana | exp-001, exp-010, exp-011, exp-014 |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-16 | D022: 不 kill exp-001；exp-013 ablation 改用 exp-002 数 | exp-001, exp-002, exp-013 |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-16 | D021: Scope 扩展——补 3 个非 Qwen 模型 + GSM8K 跨域 + constr | exp-010, exp-011, exp-012, exp-013, exp-014 |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-16 | D020: Kill 140题进程B，保留804题进程A以最大化统计力 | exp-001 |\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-16 | exp-007 (72B-AWQ) 从 P2 提升到 P1，Claim 2 至少需要 4 个模型 | exp-007, exp-004, exp-005 |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-16 | D017: D012 PASS, MVP 通过——SICA 在有多样性输入时确实≠SC（+3.3pp | sica_d012_14b |\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-16 | D017: D012 技术 PASS（C3 +3.3pp）但统计 INCONCLUSIVE（p=0. | sica_d012_14b |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-16 | D016: QwQ-32B MVP FAIL，模型 pivot 到 Qwen2.5-14B-Inst | sica_folio30, sica_proofwriter30_v2, sica_temp_diversity, sica_aime30_v3 |\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-16 | D015: FOLIO C0 预检 0% 多候选率——QwQ-32B 跨三域自一致性是模型级特征，S | sica_folio30, sica_proofwriter30_v2, sica_temp_diversity |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-16 | D014: MaxSAT 结构性失效根因确认——约束编码缺 answer assertion + 提 | sica_proofwriter30_v2 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3867, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CyzDt5vQibXScQJpWP4fnu","session_id":"f1a8255d-7c1b-4cde-83db-e0517ed18fd5","uuid":"eadde8c2-733e-4ee5-8f9a-65f1decb0203","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:10:41.408Z"}
